WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Running a dental clinic isn't just about treating patients—

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.600
it also requires managing appointments, patient records, invoices, and inventory.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.300
What if all of this could be managed in one unified software? Let me show you how.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:19.800
This is our clinic's interface. Clinsyst creates a customized workspace tailored for each clinic.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:27.800
For example, my practice is Dentivista, so our system is registered under Dentivista Dental & Aesthetics.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:32.200
Here on the main dashboard, we can view all of today's scheduled appointments,

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:36.200
and generate a new patient invoice directly from the dashboard.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:42.800
For any patient, we can record payments received and easily apply discounts right on the invoice.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:51.200
Next, in Patient Records, you can access the complete clinical history of every patient associated with your clinic.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:55.500
We can schedule appointments, log dental treatments and procedures performed,

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:59.500
and issue digital prescriptions directly inside the patient's record.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:07.800
Most importantly, we have Inventory & Stock Management—which is usually a major challenge to track in dental clinics.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:14.200
Clinsyst automatically gives you a clear overview of low-stock and out-of-stock dental supplies.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:24.000
And at the end of the month, it generates financial reports showing your clinic's revenue by date or period.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:32.500
So, as a clinic owner myself, I am very satisfied with the Clinsyst software—it saves a lot of time and energy.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:36.200
From patient appointments to follow-ups, it manages everything.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:44.000
If you are a dentist or healthcare professional looking to manage your clinic seamlessly, I highly recommend Clinsyst.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:48.500
Dentivista Dental & Aesthetics — Powered by Clinsyst Dental Cloud

